---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/schema';
const title='Minecraft Trademark Disclaimer | VoxelCurve';
const description='VoxelCurve is an independent fan-made building utility and is not affiliated with Mojang Studios or Microsoft.';
const canonical='https://voxelcurve.com/disclaimer';
const schemas=[breadcrumbSchema([{name:'VoxelCurve',url:'https://voxelcurve.com/'},{name:'Disclaimer',url:canonical}])];
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {canonical} {schemas}>
  <section class="resource-hero"><div class="container"><div class="resource-hero-grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Trademark notice</span><h1>Independent builder utility.</h1><p>VoxelCurve references Minecraft only to describe the game context in which its block blueprints can be used.</p></div>
    <div class="resource-meta"><span>STATUS</span><strong>Unofficial · Independent</strong><small>No Mojang or Microsoft affiliation.</small></div>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container editorial-grid">
    <aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="section-kicker">01 / Notice</div><p>Required brand separation.</p></aside>
    <div class="prose editorial-prose">
      <div class="callout"><strong>NOT AN OFFICIAL MINECRAFT PRODUCT. NOT APPROVED BY OR ASSOCIATED WITH MOJANG OR MICROSOFT.</strong></div>
      <h2>Minecraft references</h2>
      <p>Minecraft is a trademark of Microsoft Corporation. VoxelCurve is an independent fan-made building utility. References to Minecraft identify the game environment for which the generated block geometry is intended.</p>
      <h2>VoxelCurve branding</h2>
      <p>VoxelCurve uses its own name, visual identity and interface. It does not claim to be an official Minecraft, Mojang Studios or Microsoft product or service.</p>
      <h2>Third-party tools</h2>
      <p>References to third-party mods, file formats or software are descriptive and do not imply sponsorship, endorsement or affiliation.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
